 "message": "Hi Marcus. No, you don't need to offboard Fatima or turn off her access for the medical leave.\n\nUnder POL-OFF-02, a leave of absence (including medical) is not an offboarding. Her access stays on, and HR handles the leave. I can't start offboarding for it, and I haven't changed anything for Fatima Zahra (E011).\n\nWhat you need to do: make sure HR knows about the leave start date (Monday) and the expected length (~8 weeks) so they can set up the leave. I have nothing to file from my side.\n\nIf you have any concern about data theft or sabotage in connection with her leave, tell me and I'll escalate it to Security straight away.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-02"
 ]
}
